      {
       "id": "other",
       "label": {
        "en": "Other movements",
        "ar": "حركات أخرى"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": false
      },
      {
       "id": "closing",
       "label": {
        "en": "Closing balance",
        "ar": "الرصيد الختامي"
       },
       "type": "money",
       "required": true
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "sch_bio_difference",
     "label": {
      "en": "Difference between the closing total and the leadsheet",
      "ar": "الفرق بين الإجمالي الختامي والورقة الرئيسية"
     },
     "type": "money",
     "required": false,
     "autofill": "paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-BIO.difference",
     "readonly": true
    },
    {
     "id": "sch_bio_agrees",
     "label": {
      "en": "Schedule agrees to the leadsheet",
      "ar": "الجدول يتفق مع الورقة الرئيسية"
     },
     "type": "text",
     "required": false,
     "autofill": "paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-BIO.agrees",
     "readonly": true
    },
    {
     "id": "sch_bio_opening_difference",
     "label": {
      "en": "Difference between the opening total and the prior period",
      "ar": "الفرق بين الإجمالي الافتتاحي والفترة السابقة"
     },
     "type": "money",
     "required": false,
     "autofill": "paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-BIO.opening_difference",
     "readonly": true
    }
   ],
   "note": {
    "en": "The reconciliation of the carrying amount of biological assets from the opening to the closing of the period: purchases, births and plantings, the gain or loss from changes in fair value less costs to sell, and the decreases from sales, harvest and deaths, by class of asset. Required by IAS 41.50. Closing balance = opening + additions - disposals + transfers + revaluation + other for every component. The closing total must equal the adjusted balance of Biological assets (LS-BIO) read above; the paper computes the schedule and shows the difference.",
    "ar": "يشترطه IAS 41.50. الرصيد الختامي = الافتتاحي + الإضافات - الاستبعادات + التحويلات + إعادة التقييم + أخرى لكل مكوّن. يجب أن يساوي الإجمالي الختامي الرصيد المعدّل لـ Biological assets (LS-BIO) المقروء أعلاه؛ وتحسب الورقة الجدول وتعرض الفرق."
   }
  },
  {
